 (text "One-cable debugging: laptop USB-C -> CH334F hub -> dev kit, FSESC, MCP2221A console" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "286ff681-bbf4-581e-9550-ededdeeb19cb"))
(text "Adafruit 5997 CH334F 4-port hub on 8.5 mm sockets at the Y=0 edge; its own USB-C (upstream) faces the pod" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "f1f19f9d-78e1-58e3-9fdb-56117c81a326"))
(text "window and is the laptop port. High speed, bus powered from the laptop. Its VBUS goes to every port" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "c371fbf2-fb1f-508a-b4f1-8bb16569bbfe"))
(text "and to nothing else: HUB_VBUS never meets +5V, so the car cannot back-power the laptop and the laptop" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "e4c03053-1f83-5213-9dde-b4c9bc36232c"))
(text "cannot power the car. GND is common. Port 1 -> J601 -> Adafruit 4449 jack lead -> USB-A to C cable ->" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "5ff4fd08-8fc6-5b93-9683-e391e5dbc1dd"))
(text "dev-kit USB-C (192.168.55.1, flashing). Port 3 -> J602 -> 4449 -> the FSESC micro-USB cable." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "3c743549-5dd0-52d6-8687-00dc11b1d2d9"))
(text "Port 2 -> MCP2221A (PDIP-14, under the hub) at 3.3 V from an MCP1700 on HUB_VBUS -> 10k -> J14 3/4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4688695-5fef-526e-bde3-7e1f5644a87d"))
(text "Port 4 -> J603 spare (e.g. move the Pico USB here). The upstream header pads (D+/D-) are left open." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "69c7fcc7-20f8-5d0a-b186-8727bae2e3f0"))
(text "Route each D+/D- pair as a coupled pair over unbroken GND, short (USB 2.0 HS; 90 Ohm is not reachable on" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "9294fe43-0e91-5a5a-b9ba-7f55cbef6a95"))
(text "1.6 mm 2-layer, keep runs under 40 mm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "0c75895f-5503-59fb-8b2f-f95e533d58d1"))
